      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've had this weird dull ache around my belly button for a few hours now and it feels like it's moving down a bit towards my right side. i think it might just be bad gas or something from lunch? can i just take some ibuprofen and try to sleep it off or do i really need to go to the doctor?",
