      "content": "i get what youre saying but i really just want to know if there is anything i can do at home to calm it down so i dont have to go. like if i take some antacids or maybe some peppermint tea and just lay on a heating pad, would that be okay? i feel like if i can just get the bloating down it'll go away on its own.",
